  "description": "A modern and flexible Calendar control for .NET MAUI, designed for high performance and full customization.\n\n\t\t\tIncludes support for single and multiple date selection, custom templates, styling, and MVVM-friendly bindings. Built to deliver a smooth and consistent experience across Android, iOS, Windows, and macOS.\n\n\t\t\tPerfect for scheduling, booking, and date-based workflows in cross-platform MAUI applications.",
